# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository and check it out as LF
# everywhere. Without this, a file authored on Windows is stored with CRLF and
# then diffs whole-file against its LF twin: `src/theme/AppTheme.tsx` reads as
# 112 lines changed against the identical file in springboard-erp-template,
# purely because of line endings. That noise hides real drift in review.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must not touch.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.tgz  binary
